astraeus-data-jupiter: moon positions

Positions are piecewise Chebyshev fits of state vectors from the JPL Horizons On-Line Ephemeris System API (https://ssd.jpl.nasa.gov/api/horizons.api),
NASA/JPL-Caltech Solar System Dynamics, a US Government work used with credit. The fit error is measured against Horizons;
Horizons' own uncertainty is separate and is stated in each body's provenance in index.json.
